%% title: Roll back a Project from the UI
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant CI as deploy job, watch mode
    Op->>S: roll back, with notes
    S->>GH: dispatch deploy
    GH->>CI: run starts
    CI->>S: watch (GitHub OIDC token)
    S-->>CI: events until settled
    CI->>GH: Deployment status
